OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GTime to switch off. Join
OL,6,     GAfrodeutsche as she plays the
OL,7,     Gsoundtrack to a long, lazy Sunday
OL,8,     Gmorning, bringing you pure
OL,9,     Gcomfort and tranquillity.
OL,10,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,11,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,12,     Gof great music and chat for
OL,13,     Gweekend breakfast and, ahead of 6
OL,14,     GMusic's 10s Forever, play some of
OL,15,     Gtheir favourite tracks from the
OL,16,     Gdecade.
OL,17,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,18,     GBonnie "Prince" Billy shares some
OL,19,     Gof his favourite records and
OL,20,     GAlice Boyd talks about recording
OL,21,     Gthe natural world.
